{"name": "Herdles", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/c0016e36c6af0752f9dd652432d7ddf6.poster.avif?t=1786131685\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/c0016e36c6af0752f9dd652432d7ddf6.webm?t=1786131685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/c0016e36c6af0752f9dd652432d7ddf6.mp4?t=1786131685\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Bark to save the world!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Herdles, you play a magical dog on a mission to save the world! Zoom through four regions of a vibrant landscape, using physics-based powers to venture further, solve puzzles and overcome challenges. Unleash your secret powers with the dedicated bark button!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/ad108ee28a7efa694b46b1053186ebaf.poster.avif?t=1786131685\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/ad108ee28a7efa694b46b1053186ebaf.webm?t=1786131685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/ad108ee28a7efa694b46b1053186ebaf.mp4?t=1786131685\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Find creative solutions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along the way, you\u2019ll save corrupted creatures called \u2018Herdles\u2019. Each Herdle comes with\u00a0 new abilities \u2013 bounce, glide, break through walls, swim up waterfalls, and more. Playful experimentation is key both in the lush overworld and the ethereal dungeons of the Netherrealm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/00cd400c089d13118f101abca59ee620.poster.avif?t=1786131685\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/00cd400c089d13118f101abca59ee620.webm?t=1786131685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/00cd400c089d13118f101abca59ee620.mp4?t=1786131685\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>No combat or death</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Herdles offers deep accessibility and customization options that you can tailor to suit your comfort, needs and playstyle. Em<strong><i>bark</i></strong> on an adorable adventure with no combat or death, just cozy, joyful fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"488\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/d16de9cac4a5a3a6511a9d7225ad90cd.poster.avif?t=1786131685\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/d16de9cac4a5a3a6511a9d7225ad90cd.webm?t=1786131685\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/extras/d16de9cac4a5a3a6511a9d7225ad90cd.mp4?t=1786131685\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Based on a true dog\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The canine hero of Herdles is inspired by creative director's Christian\u2019s real-life dog, Snoopy :D</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An adorable dog hero inspired by the developer\u2019s real life pet!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore a vibrant world and uncover ethereal dungeons in the Netherrealm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open up new paths and secret areas as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No combat, no death \u2013 just cozy fun!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dedicated bark button!! (of course)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzles and challenges with creative, physics-based solutions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic platforming with a huge range of abilities!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep customization and accessibility!</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "An adorable open world platformer where you play as a magical dog. Zoom around a vibrant landscape, using an evolving arsenal of abilities to explore, solve challenges and discover secrets \u2013 one bark at a time!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2429600/caa2f9f55d9178f7f1f139279d99e352d16c8159/header.jpg?t=1786131685", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Animals", "Collectathon", "Puzzle Platformer", "3D Platformer", "Physics", "Colorful"], "developers": "Fire Sword Studios, One More Journey", "publishers": "Fire Sword Studios, One More Journey", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2429600", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "5 June 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "http